anekabuddhaśatasahastrāvaropitakuśalamūlaṃ bhaviṣyati / ye śroṣyanti prāgeva japasādhanādibhiḥ / sarvamanorathaṃ paripūrayiṣyāmi yaśca caturdaśīpaṃcadaśī māmuddiśya upavasati / cattvāriṃśat kalpasahastrāṇi saṃsārān paścānmukhīkarisyanti / tena nāmadheyamapi grahaṇena bhagavan saha so 'yaṃ buddhakoṭīniyutśatasahasrātirekasamam / mama nāmadheyagrahaṇenasarvasattvā avaivartikatvaṃ prasavanti / sarvavyādhibhiḥparimucyate / sarvāvaraṇebhyaḥ sarvabhayebhyaḥ sarvakāyavāṅmanoduścaritebhyaḥ parimokṣyante / teṣāmeva karatalagatā (

